    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   ……戦いの音が…収まったみたい…。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "……戦いの音が…収まったみたい…。"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   でもキャロル、ちょっと大変だけど休んでる時間はないみたい。急ごうか。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "でもキャロル、ちょっと大変だけど休んでる時間はないみたい。急ごうか。"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   私は大丈夫……でもボブさんがどうなったのか心配で……！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "私は大丈夫……でもボブさんがどうなったのか心配で……！"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   たぶん…大丈夫。時間が必要なだけだと思う。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "たぶん…大丈夫。時間が必要なだけだと思う。"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   時間が必要……？　それはどういう――",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "時間が必要……？　それはどういう――"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=0.3, xstrength=10, ystrength=12, vibrato=30, randomness=20, fadeout=true, block=true)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "0.3,",
        "xstrength": "10,",
        "ystrength": "12,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "20,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   あっ！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "あっ！"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   キャロル！　大丈夫？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "キャロル！　大丈夫？"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   ごめんなさい、木の根につまづいちゃって……。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "ごめんなさい、木の根につまづいちゃって……。"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   大丈夫？　はい、あたしの手をつかんで。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "大丈夫？　はい、あたしの手をつかんで。"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   ……ありがとう。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "……ありがとう。"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   歩ける？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "歩ける？"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   ……大丈夫、かすり傷だから。グラニが言った通り、はやく行かないとね。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "……大丈夫、かすり傷だから。グラニが言った通り、はやく行かないとね。"
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   この森を抜ければ、もうモティカ山の麓。そこから山の中腹にある2つ目の洞窟に入るの。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "この森を抜ければ、もうモティカ山の麓。そこから山の中腹にある2つ目の洞窟に入るの。"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"グラニ\"]   入り口はその洞窟だけ？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "グラニ",
        "content": "入り口はその洞窟だけ？"
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"キャロル\"]   ええ。中は分かれ道だらけで、しかも隠された道を通る必要があるけど、私は進み方を知ってる。財宝は洞窟の最深部に眠ってるわ。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "キャロル",
        "content": "ええ。中は分かれ道だらけで、しかも隠された道を通る必要があるけど、私は進み方を知ってる。財宝は洞窟の最深部に眠ってるわ。"
    },
